(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA) '
(MINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE & FARMERS WELFARE) '
(DEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE) '
T*
(PRADHAN MANTRI KISAN SAMMAN NIDHI [PM-KISAN] GUIDELINES) '
T*
(1. SCHEME OVERVIEW AND PURPOSE) '
(Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi [PM-KISAN] is a Central Sector Scheme launched by ) '
(the Hon'ble Prime Minister on 24th February 2019 to augment the income of all ) '
(landholding farmer families across the country. The scheme aims to assist small, ) '
(marginal, and all eligible farming households in meeting their financial needs for ) '
(procuring various agricultural inputs related to agriculture and allied activities as ) '
(well as domestic needs.) '
T*
(2. FINANCIAL BENEFIT AND PAYMENT SCHEDULE) '
(Under the PM-KISAN scheme, financial assistance of ?6,000 per annum is provided to ) '
(all eligible landholder farmer families. The amount is directly credited to the ) '
(Aadhaar-seeded bank accounts of beneficiaries in three equal four-monthly ) '
(installments of ?2,000 each:) '
(- Period 1: April to July [?2,000]) '
(- Period 2: August to November [?2,000]) '
(- Period 3: December to March [?2,000]) '
(All payments are transferred 100% via Direct Benefit Transfer [DBT] through the ) '
(Public Financial Management System [PFMS].) '
T*
(3. ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA) '
(- All landholding farmer families having cultivable landholding in their names are ) '
(eligible.) '
(- Mandatory e-KYC compliance and Aadhaar seeding with the bank account.) '
(- Land record details must be verified and updated on the state land revenue registry ) '
(portal.) '
T*
(4. EXCLUSIONS FROM BENEFITS) '
(The following categories of higher economic status are excluded:) '
(- Institutional landholders.) '
(- Former and present holders of constitutional posts, Ministers, MPs, MLAs, MLCs, ) '
(Mayors, and District Panchayat Chairpersons.) '
(- Serving or retired officers and employees of Central/State Government Ministries, ) '
(Public Sector Undertakings [PSUs], and autonomous institutions [excluding Class ) '
(IV/Multi-Tasking Staff].) '
(- All persons who paid Income Tax in the last assessment year.) '
(- Professionals like Doctors, Engineers, Lawyers, Chartered Accountants, and ) '
(Architects registered with professional bodies.) '
T*
(5. REGISTRATION AND REQUIRED DOCUMENTS) '
(Farmers can register self-online via the PM-KISAN portal [https://pmkisan.gov.in] or ) '
(mobile app, or through Common Service Centres [CSCs] and local Village Revenue ) '
(Officers.) '
(Required Documents:) '
(- Aadhaar Card [mandatory].) '
(- Land ownership document [Khasra/Khatauni / RTC / RoR].) '
(- Active Bank Account Passbook [IFSC & Account Number].) '
(- Valid Mobile Number linked with Aadhaar for OTP verification.) '
T*
(6. NODAL AUTHORITY AND GRIEVANCE REDRESSAL) '
(- Administrative Authority: Department of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare, Government ) '
(of India.) '
(- PM-KISAN Helpline Number: 155261 / 011-24300606 / Toll-Free 1800-115-526.) '
(- Email: pmkisan-ict@gov.in.) '
ET
